  "details": "Newest beta introduced \"Minor CPU performance improvements in Physics-heavy world\" which i suspect introduced new issues with the player's collisions & movement.\n\nThe player's capsule seems to be ever so slightly taller, resulting in some doorways being slightly problematic, and in the worst case, could prevent players from existing in maps completely if there aren't ways to slip around those\n\n(video related)\n\nI've yet to reproduce the physics issues i experienced earlier, but on desktop, after being affected by a velocity impulse & running into a wall, walk & strafe movement became locked. Bouncy pads have now become a potential softlock if your shift key is missing",
